            "review_title": "Review at Matsuri Japanese Restaurant - Nguyen Hue",
            "review_text": "Noo N\n5 contributions\n0\nLovely restaurant\nAug 2026 • Solo\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nA wonderful dining experience from start to finish.\n\nThe hot pot broth was light, flavorful, and comforting, allowing the freshness of the ingredients to shine. The thinly sliced beef was tender, and the vegetables were crisp and fresh. I especially loved the grilled mackerel—it had perfectly crispy skin and juicy, flavorful meat. The seared fish was another highlight, beautifully presented and delicious.\n\nThe restaurant was clean, quiet, and had a warm, relaxing atmosphere. The staff were friendly, attentive, and made the experience even more enjoyable. Every dish was beautifully presented, and the quality of the ingredients was outstanding.\n\nIf you're looking for authentic Japanese comfort food with fresh ingredients and a cozy ambiance, this is definitely worth a visit. I highly recommend it and will definitely be back!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 7, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
