            "review_title": "Review at Matsuri Japanese Restaurant - Nguyen Hue",
            "review_text": "Somobla\nCadenazzo, Switzerland984 contributions\n0\nvs all you can eat (Italy)\nMar 2026 • Couples\nIn Italy you can find all you can eat (decent) starting from 80€ per couple with 4 beers.\nLet's start from this comparison: quality, here, 100 times better! Excellent fish, top plate care, similar choice.\nImproveable service (here), considered the place I expected better.\nOverall I spent 65€ (for Vietnam a lot) but if I compare with “ayce”, clear victory of this restaurant\n\nHighlight: “wagyu è fois gras” sushi - spectacular!\nImproveable: the entrance. To go up to 2. Slowly you pass by a staircase that looks like that of a 1960 apartment building\nRead more\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten March 22, 2026",
