            "review_text": "Pham N\n20 contributions\n0\nStunning Views and Exquisite Japanese Flavors at Matsuri\nOct 2024 • Family\nHad a fantastic birthday celebration at Matsuri! The festive decor, great view, and cozy ambiance set the perfect mood. The food was amazing—fresh sashimi, sushi, vibrant salad, and flavorful grilled eel, all beautifully presented. Attentive service and authentic Japanese flavors made it an unforgettable experience. Highly recommended!\nWritten October 26, 2024",
